    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The D.O.T. icons display if an enemy is bleeding burning or poisoned. It also displays how much bleed burn or poison damage they have accrued. This value is the amount of damage they will take slowly over time. However, enemies only take full damage over time against the right type of hit points. Bleed is effeective against health, burn is effective against armor and poison is effective against shields. Enemies take half damage from D.O.T.s against the wrong hit point.\nEnemies who are bleeding / burning /poisoned also take an additional +1 health / armor / poison damage respectively."
