    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: The strongest and most brutal orcs encase themselves in as much armor as they can endure. This makes them far more durable than an ordinary orc. At the cost of speed these orcs reserve their energy to survive the final stretch of their attack. When armored orcs get within sight of the tower they let out a menacing call to arms fortifying all who surround them.
