  m_Text: Covered in wet hides and constructed of strong wood, battering rams pose a great threat to the tower. They are slow and lumbering but extremely armored. If they reach the tower undestroyed the tower will suffer a great deal of damage. Additionally, upon the destruction of a ram, its crew will abandon it and make a run for the tower themselves.
