  m_Text: 'Kill bots are the result of vile machinations of violent minds from the hells. They are created for only one task: kill. These armored robots are most dangerous once they get within missile range. Once close enough they will launch a pair of very fast missiles at the tower. Do not be distracted by their French accents, or you might find yourself on the wrong end of a missile strike.'
