    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'This strange creation is understood poorly. While not a creature, it does possess some qualities of one; namely its ability to repair and regenerate itself and its defenses. It seems to provide a direct conection between our world and another. Bizarre flying creatures pour out of this connection. The only way to close the portal seems to be its destruction. '
